724		 * Create a {@link ConfigurationPropertyName} by adapting the given source. The name
725		 * is split into elements around the given {@code separator}. This method is more
726		 * lenient than {@link #of} in that it allows mixed case names and '{@code _}'
727		 * characters. Other invalid characters are stripped out during parsing.
728		 * <p>
729		 * The {@code elementValueProcessor} function may be used if additional processing is
730		 * required on the extracted element values.
